>>__ load "simpExtLib";
>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `clear_rules`

``` hol4
simpExtLib.clear_rules : simpExtLib.simpset -> simpExtLib.simpset
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Removes rewrites, conversions, congruences, decision procedures, loopers and
fragments, retaining the rewrite maker, limit, solvers, subgoaler, condition
depth and term order. `simpExtLib.SIMP_TAC (clear_rules ss) ths` therefore
simplifies with `ths` alone under the retained settings.

### Failure

Never fails.

### Example

``` hol4
>>_ val ext_bool_ss = simpExtLib.lift_simpset boolSimps.bool_ss;
>>+ simpExtLib.SIMP_CONV
      (simpExtLib.clear_rules ext_bool_ss) [] “p ∧ T”;
>> simpExtLib.SIMP_CONV (simpExtLib.clear_rules ext_bool_ss)
     [boolTheory.AND_CLAUSES] “p ∧ T”;
```

### See also

[`simpExtLib.set_cond_depth`](#simpExtLib.set_cond_depth),
[`simpExtLib.set_subgoaler`](#simpExtLib.set_subgoaler).
